### 1. Registrar novo usuário (PUBLIC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao@gmail.com",
  "senha": "senha123",
  "papel": "USER"
}

### 2. Registrar Admin (PUBLIC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Admin User 2",
  "email": "admin2@gmail.com",
  "senha": "admin123",
  "papel": "ADMIN"
}

### 3. Login - Obter Token (PUBLIC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@gmail.com",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### 4. Login Admin - Obter Token (PUBLIC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gmail.com",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

### 5. Listar Usuários (REQUER TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 6. Criar Novo Usuário (REQUER ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Novo User",
  "email": "novo@gmail.com",
  "senha": "senha456",
  "papel": "USER"
}

### 7. Buscar Usuário por ID (REQUER TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/6a0dc1ff049756f534022982
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 8. Buscar por Email (REQUER TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/email/joao@gmail.com
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 9. Listar Ativos (REQUER TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/ativos/lista
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 10. Listar por Papel (REQUER TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/papel/USER
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 11. Atualizar Usuário (REQUER ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/6a0dc1ff049756f534022982
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "João Silva Updated",
  "email": "joao.updated@gmail.com",
  "senha": "novaSenha123",
  "papel": "USER"
}

### 12. Alterar Status (REQUER ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/6a0dc1ff049756f534022982/status?ativo=false
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 13. Deletar Usuário (REQUER ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/6a0dc1ff049756f534022982
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 14. Sem Autenticação (DEVE RETORNAR 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
